    <h1>The Investigation Department Has No Qualifications</h1>
    <div class="author">WRITTEN BY BLACK JOHN</div>
  </header>

  <main class="story">

    <p class="location">Location: Arman's meeting spot.</p>

    <p>Arman is waiting for Johnny.</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "So what's the emergency?"</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "What emergency?"</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "Ranveer called me like the government was about to collapse."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "I just asked him to call you."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "Never outsource communication to that man again."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "Anyway, how did it go with Divya?"</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "She's still Divya."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "That explains nothing."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "Exactly."</p>

    <p>Arman asks about the conversation.</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "Did you find out why she and Kajal became friends?"</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "Apparently, people change."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "That's it?"</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "She also called me a creep."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "Well, that's not new information."</p>

    <h2 class="scene-heading">The investigation</h2>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "Something doesn't add up."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "Or maybe there's nothing to add up."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "Two people who couldn't stand each other suddenly becoming best friends? That's suspicious."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "Maybe they bonded."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "Over what?"</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "I don't know. Friendship?"</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "You're not helping."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "I wasn't aware I was being paid."</p>

    <p>Johnny looks at him.</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "You will be compensated with my appreciation."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "Keep it."</p>

    <h2 class="scene-heading">Meanwhile...</h2>

    <p>Divya and Kajal are seen together.</p>

    <p>They seem perfectly comfortable around each other.</p>

    <p>Johnny notices them.</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "There they are."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "They're just talking."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "Exactly. Suspicious."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "You're making me regret coming here."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Johnny: "Friendship is a strange phenomenon."</p>

    <p class="dialogue">Arman: "So is your brain."</p>

